  "fullDescription": "The Christmas Planner Canva Template contains many sheets! Use these for your Christmas Planner Kit and for excellent Christmas Planning! It includes an Editable Christmas Calendar which you can add to your Christmas Planner Binder. The Canva planner templates come in shades of green and terracotta, but you can change everything in these templates from fonts, colors, elements, shapes, layouts, and more! All you need is a free Canva account!\n\nWhat is included:\n\n• 113 templates to edit in Canva\n\n• Design/Color Palette: Terra\n\n• Size: A4 + US letter\n\nThe templates include the following:\n\nTHE CHRISTMAS PLANNER (83 SHEETS) Fully Editable:\n\n• Christmas Party Details\n\n• Brainstorm Sheet\n\n• Complete Christmas Party Checklist\n\n• Christmas Checklist (Blank)\n\n• Christmas To-Do List (2 design layouts)\n\n• Holiday Help List\n\n• Budget Overview + Breakdown\n\n• Expenses Sheet\n\n• Menu Ideas\n\n• Final Menu\n\n• Cooking List\n\n• Baking List\n\n• Christmas Recipe\n\n• Christmas Drinks\n\n• Dietary Requirements\n\n• Portion Guide\n\n• Oven Space Planner\n\n• Shopping List\n\n• Gift Ideas (2 design layouts)\n\n• Gift List\n\n• Stocking Stuffers\n\n• Wishlists\n\n• Gift Supplies Sheet\n\n• Christmas Cards to Send\n\n• Christmas Messages to Send\n\n• Thank You Cards to Send\n\n• Decor Ideas & Inspiration Sheet\n\n• Decor Inventory\n\n• Indoor Decor Planner\n\n• Outdoor Decor Planner\n\n• Tree Decor Planner\n\n• Christmas Table Planner\n\n• Kiddies Table Planner\n\n• Guest List\n\n• RSVP List\n\n• Invitation Planner\n\n• Advent Calendar\n\n• Daily Planner\n\n• Weekly Planner + Checklist\n\n• Day Planners (Christmas Eve, Christmas Day, Boxing Day)\n\n• Christmas Countdown Sheet\n\n• Timeline\n\n• Schedule\n\n• Naughty Elf Ideas\n\n• Christmas Crafts\n\n• Holiday Projects\n\n• Homemade Gift Ideas\n\n• Games & Activities\n\n• Advent Activities\n\n• Family Photo Shoot\n\n• Family Favorites\n\n• Traditions\n\n• Black Friday Shopping List\n\n• Cyber Week Shopping List\n\n• Store Shopping List\n\n• Online Shopping Tracker\n\n• 25 Acts of Kindness\n\n• Charities & Holiday Donations\n\n• Bucket Lists (Christmas, Holiday, Winter)\n\n• Holiday Goals\n\n• Carols to Sing\n\n• Books to Read\n\n• Movies to Watch\n\n• Christmas Playlist\n\n• Christmas Savings Tracker (2 design layouts)\n\n• Black Calendars (Oct-Dec)\n\n• 3-month Calendar\n\n• Memo Sheet\n\nCOVERS + DIVIDERS:\n\n• 2 Cover Sheets (fully editable)\n\n• Divider Sheets (fully editable)\n\nKIDS SHEETS:\n\n• Kids Activity Sheets (14 Pages, fully editable)\n\n• Santa Sheets (letter to Santa, Draw a picture, My Wishlist – fully editable)\n\n🤩 FREE BONUS: 10 x free sheets to play around with – sign up via email! (A link to sign up is provided in the ‘BONUS’ PDF upon your purchase 🙂\n\n⚠️ Please take note: These are not fillable PDF files/templates (i.e. you are unable to type directly into the boxes). They are meant to be changed the way you like, with a free Canva account, and printed out to be filled in by hand. If you wish to type directly into the template, you’ll need to manually add text boxes (instructions provided in the help guide pdf).\n\n♥ What is Canva? ♥\n\nFree online design software to create anything you want to!\n\nTHE SUPER IMPORTANT STUFF:\n\n• You will need a Canva account to edit these templates. Don’t worry, it’s free! Sign up at canva.com.\n\n• Use a desktop to edit these templates in Canva (though they have an App, it is quite limiting)\n\n• Canva links can NOT be resold, meaning you will need to change them up and download them as a final PDF, PNG, or JPEG.\n\nHOW DOES IT WORK?\n\n1. After purchasing you will be able to download the PDFs (one will contain the link to the template/s, and the other one is the Help Guide)\n\n2. Open the link in the PDF to go to Canva.com, where you can start editing right away 🙂\n\n3. See the Help Guide PDF in case you’re new to Canva — I have added some easy steps with images!\n\n©TWCprintables",
